      <h1 >JDS Public School &ndash; A brief Profile</h1>
      
      <p><strong>JDS Public School</strong>  Varanasi, has been established as a result of vision visualized by Maj. (Retd.) S.R.Singh, to impart quality education to the children of Varanasi, at the most affordable cost.</p>
      <p><strong>JDS Public School </strong>is a co &ndash; educational English Medium School, with modern school campus, which include, well ventilated class room, state of art computer lab, well equipped Science labs, Smart Class and one of the best stocked library, The School Campus can proudly boast of having one of the best Playgrounds and a well defined transport system.</p>
      <p>We believe that Academics is the epicenter of good education, but education is all around development of a child, thus; at JDS a child is exposed to the best education imparted by highly qualified teaching faculties and is also encouraged to develop his/her latent talents with the help of our extra- circular program &amp; hobby- classes. </p>
      <h1>Our Vision</h1>
    <p>Our Vision is aimed at :-</p>
       <ul>
         <li>&bull; Make every child at JDS Public School a  philanthropist in their own way so that our future generations could live in a  better world.&nbsp; We make them fully  understand, on the sidelines of academics that Ecological and environmental  issues are equally important to us and our future generations. We augment our ongoing effort to enhance the  sensitivity of children towards water harvesting, Afforestation, ethical  treatment to Animals, respect of elderly and human rights.</li>
       </ul>
       <ul>
         <li>&bull; We take extra care of girl child and lesser fortunate children. At JDS, we are looking after the the  education part of children adopted by an NGO and make sure that they exploit  their potential to the maximum possible extent. We are working with some other  NGOs (Non-Governmental Organisations) also on social welfare issues. Our School ie JDS Public School is  playing a pivotal role in the entire process. </li>
       </ul>
    <h1>The Mission</h1></p>
        
  To fulfill the vision, <strong>JDS Public School</strong> provides an environment in which every student discovers and realizes his full potential. The school should attract the best talent &ndash; Students, Teachers and Facilitators &ndash; from all parts of India, without any discrimination of race, religion, caste or social status.</div>
